WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.950
Jamie waits for Ryu’s Level 3 fall before the heavy pickup.

2
00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:01.400
Rush crouching heavy punch catches Ryu at the corner.

3
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.400
Heavy Arrow continues the juggle.

4
00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:03.200
The later normal Arrow hit keeps Ryu airborne.

5
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.150
OD Arrow catches Ryu before the fall.

6
00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:04.950
OD Arrow continues the multi-hit juggle.

7
00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:06.300
Ryu lies at the corner after the second Arrow.
